  (text "J1: 1=GND 2=C2D 3=C2CK 4=3V3. TP7/TP8: UART0 for the factory bootloader (C2D low at reset)."
    (at 86.36 73.66 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "326b5b21-f043-4f36-b525-66704bb366d6")
  )
  (text "QFN32: own BEACON pin (P1.7 = PCA CEX0 during a reply), C2D not shared, 9 spares driven low."
    (at 78.74 184.15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "1975c985-79b6-43ce-a80c-9ffe094540f5")
  )
  (text "P0.0 = VREF (precision 2.4 V, C50). SENSE = P0.2, digital and ADC at once (PRTDRV.COEX)."
    (at 78.74 193.67 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "fa1a4656-52b0-45a6-a8b8-90425d56436a")
  )
  (text "EP is the only GND pin: solder it, with vias. VDD: 1 uF + 100 nF at the pin (AN203)."
    (at 78.74 187.33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "2d5727a0-6dc3-4690-93a7-7355d892b70e")
  )
  (text "SYSCLK = HFOSC0/8 = 3.0625 MHz, Snooze when idle (no clock, no spurs). ILNA RC: fc = 1.6 kHz"
    (at 78.74 190.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "df0b3355-a606-4563-acfd-6cbf149084eb")
  )
